  "bodyHash": "jiG71LM2DoQ=",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Vg7xUZU.png\" width=\"472\" height=\"156\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Forge-Only-d9aa6b?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=condaforge&amp;logoColor=d9aa6b&amp;labelColor=26303d\" alt=\"\" width=\"140\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/需要-Upgraded Netherite-F16436?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=FFFFFF&amp;labelColor=1C1C1C\" width=\"280\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-ultimerite/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=1738749986:70886\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/1.16.x-維護中-yellow?style=plastic\" alt=\"\" width=\"124\" height=\"18\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-ultimerite/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=1738749986:73242\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/1.17.x-不支援-red?style=plastic\" alt=\"\" width=\"126\" height=\"18\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-ultimerite/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=1738749986:73250\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/1.18.x-維護中-yellow?style=plastic\" width=\"124\" height=\"18\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-ultimerite/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=1738749986:73407\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/1.19.x-積極開發中-green?style=plastic\" width=\"166\" height=\"18\"></a>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7hyxts1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">請使用 CurseForge 下載，請勿重新託管檔案。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">此模組可用於任何模組包中（在 CurseForge 上）。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">目前沒有計劃推出 Fabric 版本，抱歉。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f00\">針對那些詢問鏟鎬斧（Paxels）的人 ➜</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-tools\" rel=\"nofollow\">Upgraded Tools</a></span></strong>&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f00\">Spartan Weaponry 的附加組件 ➜</span><span style=\"color:#36f\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-spartan-weaponry\" rel=\"nofollow\">Upgraded Netherite : Spartan Weaponry</a></span></strong>&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f00\">可用的替代紋理 ➜</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/upgraded-netherite-alternative\" rel=\"nofollow\">Upgraded Netherite : Alternative</a></span></strong><span style=\"color:#000\">&nbsp;（已更新！）</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7hyxts1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>描述</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">新增超終界（Ultimerite）盔甲、馬鎧、武器和工具。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7hyxts1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>合成配方</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/469/650/ultimeriteingot.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"155\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/469/651/output_qajrzi.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"61\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">1.19：</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/469/652/1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"155\"></span></strong>&nbsp;<strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/469/653/1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"155\"></span></strong></p>\n</div><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7hyxts1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">效果</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>超終界（Ultimerite）</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>盔甲與馬鎧</strong></em>：繼承其他盔甲的效果（可設定）。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>武器與工具</strong></em>：繼承其他武器和工具的效果（可設定）。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">你可以透過在合成台上與特定材料結合，來啟用或停用其他盔甲、武器和工具的效果。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em>金錠</em></strong>：用於<strong><em>黃金界（Golderite）</em></strong>效果。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em>烈焰桿</em></strong>：用於<strong><em>烈焰界（Blazerite）</em></strong>效果。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em>終界珍珠</em></strong>：用於<strong><em>終界界（Enderite）</em></strong>效果。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em>海磷晶體</em></strong>：用於<strong><em>海磷界（Prismarite）</em></strong>效果。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em>凋零骷髏頭顱</em></strong>：用於<strong><em>凋零界（Witherite）</em></strong>效果。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em>蜘蛛眼</em></strong>：用於<strong><em>蜘蛛界（Spiderite）</em></strong>效果。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em>夜魅膜</em></strong>：用於<strong><em>夜魅界（Phanterite）</em></strong>效果。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em>羽毛</em></strong>：用於<strong><em>羽毛界（Featherite）</em></strong>效果。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7hyxts1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>設定</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">用戶端</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><code>upgradednetherite_ultimate-client.toml</code>&nbsp;位於&nbsp;<code>/config</code>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">伺服器端</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><code>upgradednetherite_ultimate-server.toml</code>&nbsp;位於&nbsp;<code>/saves/WORLD_NAME/serverconfigs</code></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">將此檔案複製到您的&nbsp;<code>/defaultconfigs</code>&nbsp;資料夾中，即可將這些設定套用至所有新建立的世界。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">專用伺服器在此路徑下有此檔案：&nbsp;<code>/world/serverconfigs</code></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7hyxts1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>我的其他模組</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">1.20 以上版本</span></em></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-trims\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/DDjo2cf.png\" width=\"262\" height=\"62\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-trims\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/jTc5hni.png\" width=\"210\" height=\"62\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-additional-trims\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/oC1EQZw.png\" width=\"210\" height=\"78\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-totems\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/W7CebyS.png\" width=\"210\" height=\"62\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-tools\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/n9kZnB2.png\" width=\"210\" height=\"62\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether-gear-expansion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/utZxZ4t.png\" width=\"270\" height=\"62\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">較舊版本</span></em></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VV3KsKX.png\" width=\"236\" height=\"62\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-items\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iAwAGmm.png\" width=\"236\" height=\"78\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-spartan-weaponry\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QL8sbmz.png\" width=\"236\" height=\"78\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-creativerite\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2lTS4p1.png\" width=\"236\" height=\"78\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-aetherite\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/g7c0DLT.png\" width=\"236\" height=\"78\"></a></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7hyxts1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p>",
